---
import Layout from '../../src/layouts/WorkspaceLayout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Participant help">
  <section class="wrap section">
    <h1>Prepare your showcase page</h1>
    <ol>
      <li>Use the email address in your organiser invitation. If an Access screen appears, verify the same approved email address there first.</li>
      <li>On the participant sign-in page, enter your invitation code and select “This is my first invitation code”. For later visits, use “Send email code”.</li>
      <li>Open your assigned project. Add your public name, project description, images, image descriptions and credits. Save your draft as you go.</li>
      <li>When you are ready, submit a saved version for review and confirm your permission to publish it.</li>
    </ol>
    <p>Submission, approval and publication are separate steps. Your current public page stays online while later edits are reviewed.</p>
    <p>If your invitation has not arrived, a code has expired or your project is missing, contact the organiser through your existing correspondence. There is no public account registration.</p>
    <p><a class="button dark" href="/participant/login/">Participant sign in</a></p>
  </section>
</Layout>
